abstract: "A reusable analysis framework based on Ray Dalio's public methodology, including the Economic Machine Model (Three Forces), Long-Term Debt Cycle and Beautiful Deleveraging, Debt Crisis Archetype, All-Weather Portfolio, Principles-Driven Decision Making, and World Order / Big Cycle. Designed to assist in macro debt cycle analysis, deleveraging path assessment, asset allocation strategy, and global order transition analysis. This skill provides a thinking framework and writing style calibration, and does NOT claim to represent Ray Dalio personally, Bridgewater Associates, or their unpublished research."
